{"id": "68459", "title": "玉骨销魂", "author": "立方水", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68459.htm", "intro": "别人的穿越总是和一票阿哥谈惊天地泣鬼神的恋爱。\r\n我的穿越却做了同父异母的兄妹。\r\n是金贵的公主，那又如何，身子是身子，灵魂是灵魂，爱情总是不受控制。\r\n可是，要我跟康熙说：“皇阿玛，我不想做你女儿了，因为我看上你家儿子了。”？？？\r\n爱与不爱，或者还有第三选择? \r\n搜索关键字：\r\n唔…好吧…因为有大大抗议,所以把标题改了\r\n加注:本文很雷,非常雷,一女N男,NP,含H,不伦…慎入,慎入\r\n\r\n\r\n天啊。。。。把康师傅也拉下水了。。。有米有？？那个啥？？？\r\n\r\n \r\n 额滴神啊~太雷了~~\r\n怎么把康熙和他儿子们搞在一起了。。\r\n不是一般的乱~", "base": "files/article/html/68/68459", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10530356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10530357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10530358.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10530359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10530360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10530361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10530362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10530363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10530364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10530365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10530366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10530367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10530368.html", "available": false}]}